  {%- comment -%}
    Centrale anatomy — the point of this block is to separate the three
    WAN paths from the Zigbee radio before the failover simulator, since
    visitors routinely assume a box outage disarms their sensors.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-section pv-section--alt">
    <div class="pv-wrap">
      <div class="pv-contents__head pv-reveal">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow">La centrale PA501Z</span>
        <h2>Quatre réseaux, un seul boîtier</h2>
        <p>Trois chemins pour joindre Internet, un quatrième pour parler aux capteurs. C'est cette architecture qui sépare l'Élite du reste de la gamme.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pe-anat pv-reveal">
        <div class="pe-specs">
          <div class="pe-spec">
            <div class="pe-spec__k">Accessoires</div>
            <div class="pe-spec__v">200 max.</div>
            <p class="pe-spec__n">Compatible avec une grande partie de la gamme SA501.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-spec">
            <div class="pe-spec__k">Batterie de secours</div>
            <div class="pe-spec__v">10 heures</div>
            <p class="pe-spec__n">Le système reste armé pendant une coupure de courant.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-spec">
            <div class="pe-spec__k">Radio capteurs</div>
            <div class="pe-spec__v">Bidirectionnelle chiffrée</div>
            <p class="pe-spec__n">Anti-brouillage et détection d'arrachement d'un périphérique.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-spec">
            <div class="pe-spec__k">Application</div>
            <div class="pe-spec__v">Daewoo Home Connect</div>
            <p class="pe-spec__n">iOS et Android, gratuite. Alarme et caméras au même endroit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pe-rails">
          <div class="pe-rail pe-rail--eth">
            <span class="pe-rail__ic" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 9V6h10v3M8 19v2M16 19v2"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <div class="pe-rail__t">Ethernet RJ45</div>
              <p class="pe-rail__d">Un câble jusqu'à la box. Insensible au Wi-Fi saturé du voisinage.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="pe-rail__rank">Prioritaire</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-rail pe-rail--wifi">
            <span class="pe-rail__ic" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5a10 10 0 0 1 14 0M8.5 16a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="19.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <div class="pe-rail__t">Wi-Fi 2,4 GHz</div>
              <p class="pe-rail__d">Si le câble n'est pas possible. Indispensable aux caméras, dans tous les cas.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="pe-rail__rank">Relais</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-rail pe-rail--4g">
            <span class="pe-rail__ic" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V10M9 20V6M14 20v-9M19 20V4"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <div class="pe-rail__t">4G+ données mobiles</div>
              <p class="pe-rail__d">Carte SIM M2M en option. Prend la main automatiquement si Internet tombe.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="pe-rail__rank">Secours</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-rail pe-rail--zig">
            <span class="pe-rail__ic" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m13 2-9 11h7l-2 9 9-11h-7l2-9Z"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <div class="pe-rail__t">Passerelle Zigbee 3.0</div>
              <p class="pe-rail__d">Le réseau interne entre la centrale et vos capteurs. Indépendant d'Internet.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="pe-rail__rank">Capteurs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    Continuity matrix. Replaces an earlier tabbed simulator that the
    merchant found unclear: the three situations now sit side by side so
    a visitor compares them without clicking anything. Camera rows say
    plainly that the video stream is Wi-Fi only and is lost in both
    outages, SIM or no SIM.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-section">
    <div class="pv-wrap">
      <div class="pv-contents__head pv-reveal">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow pe-eyebrow--amber">Continuité de service</span>
        <h2>Ce qui continue de fonctionner, quoi qu'il arrive</h2>
        <p>Trois situations, cinq fonctions. Sans rien enjoliver.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pe-matrix pv-reveal">
        <table>
          <caption class="pv-visually-hidden">Fonctionnement du pack Élite {{ variant.sku | default: '%%SKU%%' }} selon la situation</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Fonction</th>
              <th scope="col">Tout va bien<span>Box et courant en service</span></th>
              <th scope="col">Box internet coupée<span>Avec carte SIM 4G+</span></th>
              <th scope="col">Coupure de courant<span>Avec carte SIM 4G+</span></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Détection et sirènes</th>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui</span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">La centrale n'a pas besoin d'internet pour déclencher</span></span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">10 h sur la batterie de secours</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Alertes d'intrusion sur votre téléphone</th>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui</span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">Notification, SMS et appel via la 4G+</span></span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">Notification, SMS et appel via la 4G+</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Pilotage depuis l'application</th>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui</span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">Armer, désarmer, consulter l'historique</span></span></td>
              <td><span class="pe-state pe-state--ok"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Oui<span class="pe-state__note">Pendant les 10 h d'autonomie</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Flux vidéo des caméras</th>
